{
  "uid": "polaris-traces-logs-explorer",
  "title": "Traces and logs explorer",
  "description": "Entry point for the alert to trace to log click-path (OBS-DIA-1): filter by service, environment and trace ID.",
  "tags": [
    "polaris",
    "explorer",
    "traces",
    "logs"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total, service)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "qryType": 1
        },
        "definition": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total, service)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Environment (logs)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "refId": "LokiVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "type": 1,
          "label": "deployment_environment"
        },
        "definition": "deployment_environment",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "trace_id",
        "label": "Trace ID (optional)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to use",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "1. **Metric to trace:** on a latency panel, click an exemplar (diamond) to open the trace in Tempo.\n2. **Trace to logs:** in the trace view use *Logs for this span* (Tempo datasource is wired to Loki by `trace_id`).\n3. **Log to trace:** in a log line, the `trace_id` field has a *View trace* link.\n4. Paste a trace ID above to filter the logs panel. Explore: [Tempo](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22refId%22:%22A%22,%22queryType%22:%22traceql%22,%22query%22:%22%7B%7D%22%7D%5D%7D) | [Loki](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22loki%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22refId%22:%22A%22,%22expr%22:%22%7Bservice_name%3D~%5C%22.%2B%5C%22%7D%22%7D%5D%7D) | [Prometheus](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22prometheus%22,%22queries%22:%5B%7B%22refId%22:%22A%22,%22expr%22:%22up%22%7D%5D%7D)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Span rate by service",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service)(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Error spans by service",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (service)(rate(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"$service\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Recent error traces",
      "description": "TraceQL search; click a trace ID to open it (trace to logs and to metrics are configured on the Tempo datasource).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" && status = error }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Slowest traces (>1s)",
      "description": "TraceQL search; click a trace ID to open it (trace to logs and to metrics are configured on the Tempo datasource).",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" && duration > 1s }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment=~\"$env\"} | trace_id=~\"$trace_id.*\"",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Note",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 2,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 43
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "`env` filters Loki panels only: span and app metrics carry no `deployment.environment` label today (Tempo only exposes it on `traces_target_info`, and only for services that set it)."
      }
    }
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "title": "Polaris dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "polaris"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ]
}
